      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried the water thing but it just makes it feel even more sensitive when the water touches it... and the blisters are definitely getting bigger. i really dont want to drive to a clinic and wait for hours. i have some high strength tea tree oil and some coconut oil too, wouldn't an oil be better for keeping the skin moist so it doesn't scab over too hard? it feels like the oil would just coat it and protect it better than a bandage.",
